sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant KR as Keyring
    participant P as Provider (Backend)
    participant OS as OS Credential Store / WebCrypto

    App->>KR: NewKeyring(service, provider) / OpenKeyring(service, provider)
    Note over KR: Keyring holds service & provider instance

    App->>KR: Set(key, value)
    KR->>P: Set(service, key, value)
    P->>OS: Store secret
    OS-->>P: Success / Error
    P-->>KR: Return result
    KR-->>App: Return result

    App->>KR: Get(key)
    KR->>P: Get(service, key)
    P->>OS: Retrieve secret
    OS-->>P: Return value / ErrNotFound
    P-->>KR: Return value / ErrNotFound
    KR-->>App: Return value / ErrNotFound

    App->>KR: Delete(key)
    KR->>P: Delete(service, key)
    P->>OS: Delete secret
    OS-->>P: Success / ErrNotFound
    P-->>KR: Return result
    KR-->>App: Return result
